    Wenk EH, Sauquet H, Gallagher RV, Brownlee R, Boettiger C, et al. (2024)
    The AusTraits Plant Dictionary. Scientific Data 11:537.
    https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-024-03368-z

and, where you depend on a specific version, the Zenodo deposit for that
version under the concept DOI:

    https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8040789
